            </div>
            <a href="https://www.som.polimi.it/en/faculty/paravano-alessandro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Institutional profile ↗</a>
          </article>
          <article class="about-row">
            <div>
              <h3>Researcher, Space Economy Observatory</h3>
              <p>Osservatori Digital Innovation, Politecnico di Milano</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://eng.osservatori.net/space-economy-eng/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Observatory ↗</a>
          </article>
          <article class="about-row">
            <div>
              <h3>Member, IAF Space Economy Committee</h3>
              <p>International Astronautical Federation, 2024-2027 committee</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.iafastro.org/about/iaf-committees/technical-committees/space-economy-committee.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Committee ↗</a>
          </article>
          <article class="about-row">
            <div>
              <h3>Department Editor</h3>
              <p>Project Management Journal</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-background-section" aria-labelledby="background-heading">
      <div class="container about-section-grid">
        <div class="about-section-heading">
