              <p class="about-background-detail">Doctoral thesis: <em>Value architecting in project ecologies: an investigation in the Space Economy</em>.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <p class="about-background-label">MSc, Cum Laude</p>
              <h3>Management Engineering</h3>
              <p class="about-background-detail">Politecnico di Milano and Delft University of Technology.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
          <div class="about-teaching-note">
            <span>Teaching</span>
            <p>Current teaching at Politecnico di Milano includes Space Economy and Earth Observation Business and aerospace project management.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="recognition-heading">
