              <h3>Fulbright scholarship</h3>
              <p>Research period at The Ohio State University focused on commercial space stations and value creation in the Space Economy.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.som.polimi.it/en/highlights/space-economy-and-international-research-alessandro-paravano-wins-a-fulbright-and-meets-president-mattarella/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">POLIMI ↗</a>
          </article>
          <article class="about-recognition-item">
            <span>2025</span>
            <div>
              <h3>SGAC-OHB SE Competition award</h3>
              <p>Recognition for research on commercial space station ecosystems and value creation in Low Earth Orbit.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.som.polimi.it/en/highlights/polimi-school-of-management-among-the-winners-of-the-sgac-ohb-se-competition-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">POLIMI ↗</a>
          </article>
          <article class="about-recognition-item">
            <span>2024</span>
            <div>
              <h3>PMI Young Researcher Award</h3>
              <p>International recognition from the Project Management Institute for early-career research in project studies.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-explore-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-explore-heading">
          <h2>Explore the work</h2>
          <p>Research pages, publications and contact information provide deeper access to the work and its applications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-explore-links">
          <a href="/research/">
